# Visual tokens

Colors stay `#0b0b0b`, `#c8ff2e`, `#f5f5f2`, dark `#121212`. Text on lime is `#0b0b0b`.

One `.btn.p` per region. `.btn.d` is last. Min height 48px until 860px. Spacing scale: 8, 12, 16, 24, 48, 72. Page padding 12 at 320px.

```css
/* BAD: two filled buttons, white type on lime */
.btn.p { color: #fff; }

/* GOOD */
.btn.p { background: var(--ac); color: #0b0b0b; }
.btn.d { margin-inline-start: auto; }
```

Read `.cursor/skills/mobile-320-a11y/SKILL.md` before saving layout changes. Do not remove `:focus-visible`.
